== Effect ==
* Adds a 10% chance to fire tears that bounce off of enemies and obstacles.
** {{dlc|nr+}} The chance is not affected by luck.
*** {{dlc|r+}} The chance is now affected by luck, maxing out at 100% at 18 luck.

== Notes ==
* Super Ball's tear effect functions identically to {{I|Rubber Cement}}. For a full list of interactions and synergies, see that page.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 20% and having both to 33%.

